{
  "id": "LeadAsstCrm00001",
  "name": "Assistant · CRM",
  "description": "Keeps the CRM (HubSpot, GoHighLevel or both, per the business profile) in step with the conversation.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Keep the CRM up to date\nCalled at the end of every reply turn. A person gets a CRM record once they have given a phone number or email (people are merged across channels before that, so the CRM gets one record per person). The business profile's `crm.providers` picks the CRM: HubSpot (here), GoHighLevel (**Assistant · CRM (GoHighLevel)**), or both.\nHubSpot: contact found by email or phone, never duplicated; one deal per person, its stage follows the conversation (stage map in the profile); one note per conversation, rewritten with the summary, the details collected and the transcript.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "6c1c9300-803d-4bfb-a03d-0952c82a6e3f",
      "name": "Note: crm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -320
      ]
    },
